<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Avgold details current hedge position.</title>
<headline>Avgold details current hedge position.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold mining company Avgold Ltd on Tuesday detailed its current hedging position as folows:</p>
<p>			  30 June    30 June    30 June    30 June</p>
<p>Forward sales:	1998	 1999	 2000	 2001+</p>
<p> kilograms sold     17,602     373	  373	  933</p>
<p> ounces sold	  565,916    12,000     12,000     30,000</p>
<p> average Rand/kg    55,986     73,037     81,043     95,376</p>
<p>Purchases of puts:</p>
<p> kilograms sold     10,197</p>
<p> ounces sold	  327,832</p>
<p> average Rand/kg    54,444</p>
<p>Sales of calls:</p>
<p> kilograms sold     1,286	4,677	1,609</p>
<p> ounces sold	  41,352     150,378    51,734</p>
<p> average Rand/kg    55,726     59,771     57,164</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
